#EXTINF:1704 group-title="T",The Golden Bough A Study In Magic And Religion Part Iv Adonis Attis Osiris Volume I — James Frazer · II. ADONIS IN SYRIA. Adonis and Astarte worshipped at Byblus- the kingdom of Cinyras- Divinity of Semitic kings- Kings named Adonis- Sacred men- Divinity of Hebrew kings- The Baal and Baalath the sources of fertility- Personation of the Baal by the king- Cinyras- king of Byblus- Aphaca and the vale of the Adonis. - Read by Leon Harvey - Duration 00:28:24
