#EXTINF:2237 group-title="T",The Golden Bough Part 2 — James Frazer · II - THE PERILS OF THE SOUL - Part 2. Abduction of souls by demons and gods- Lost souls brought back in a visible form- Soul recovered from the earth- Recovery of the soul in ancient Egypt- Souls stolen or detained by sorcerers- Souls taken by head-hunters- Abduction of souls by Malay wizards- Souls extracted from the stomachs of doctors. - Read by Leon Harvey - Duration 00:37:17
